<title>UK: Guinness sees merger costs below 91 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Guinness sees merger costs below 91 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guinness Plc expects the cost of its merger with Grand Metropolitan Plc to be less than 91 million stg, finance director Phil Yea told shareholders at the company's annual meeting.</p>
</text>
